Build snuffleupagus 0.14.0 instead of 0.12.0. 0.13 fixed CVE-2026-22034, a possible arbitrary code execution on misconfigured `upload_validation` deployments, and 0.14 fixed an opcache inlining issue that let calls bypass return-value rules. The webmail SSO plugins also stop passing the HTTP status code as `header()`'s second argument, which is `bool $replace`: Mailu enables `sp.global_strict`, so those calls are type errors waiting to happen.
